                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A well designed 2D precision platformer\n\n+good price\n+good atmosphere / overall presentation\n+using xbox controller works fine\n+controls are pleasant, fast and sensitive\n+fun story (told by text - not animations)\n+level design and progression is awesome (50 levels)\n+Got 100% achievements one minute after \n  finishing first run ( 3 hours playtime)\n\n#some really mean (in the way of cheap) death traps\n#a few tombs are demanding a lot of timing and precision.\n#trial-n-error gameplay\n\n-One point lowering the fun were some dead inputs\n  using the double-jump. \n\n\nAll-in-all I really recommend",
